---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: false
description: The Kenya-China Tea Summit 2027 brings tea exporters, buyers, investors and technology providers together in Nairobi from 21–23 April 2027. Register your interest.
permalink: /index.html
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__inner wrap">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">{{ summit.dates.display }} · {{ summit.location.city }}, {{ summit.location.country }}</p>
    <h1 class="hero__title">The premier tea trade, investment and innovation forum connecting Africa and China</h1>
    <p class="hero__lede">{{ summit.theme }}</p>
    <p class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/registration/">Register your interest</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/programme/">See the three-day programme</a>
    </p>
    <p class="hero__note">Registration opens in six categories, from delegate to exhibitor. Prices and deadlines are announced closer to the summit.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band wrap">
  <h2 class="section-title">What this summit is</h2>
  <p class="lede">A landmark international platform designed to deepen trade, investment, innovation and cultural cooperation between Kenya and China within the tea value chain.</p>
  <p><a class="link-arrow" href="/about/">More about the summit</a></p>
</section>

<section class="band band--sunk">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">Six objectives</h2>
    <ul class="cards" role="list">
      {% for o in summit.objectives %}
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="card__title">{{ o.title }}</h3>
        <p class="card__body">{{ o.body }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band wrap">
  <h2 class="section-title">Three days</h2>
  <ol class="days" role="list">
    {% for d in summit.programme %}
    <li class="day">
      <p class="day__label">Day {{ d.day }} · <time datetime="{{ d.date }}">{{ d.date | readableDate }}</time></p>
      <h3 class="day__title">{{ d.title }}</h3>
      <p class="day__summary">{{ d.summary }}</p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  <p><a class="link-arrow" href="/programme/">Full programme</a></p>
</section>

<section class="band band--invert">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">Who comes</h2>
    <ul class="tags" role="list">
      {% for a in summit.audiences %}
      <li class="tag">{{ a }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band wrap cta-band">
  <h2 class="section-title">Take part</h2>
  <p class="lede">Registration, exhibition stands and partnership packages are all open for expressions of interest. Tell us which one fits and the secretariat will come back to you.</p>
  <p class="hero__actions">
    <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/registration/">Register your interest</a>
    <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/sponsorship/">Partner with the summit</a>
  </p>
</section>
